PN,37201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,FTemperatures are so high in bus cabs
OL,8,Fthat drivers risk causing fatal
OL,9,Fcrashes and passing out at the wheel,
OL,10,Fstriking drivers have warned.
OL,12,FDrivers likened their cabs to being in
OL,13,Fa greenhouse or oven, with
OL,14,Ftemperatures exceeding 40C as a result
OL,15,Fof having no air conditioning in
OL,16,Frecord heatwave conditions.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,FMore than 1,500 Arriva North London
OL,8,Fbus drivers, from eight garages in
OL,9,Fnorth and east London and Essex,
OL,10,Fstarted two days of industrial action
OL,11,Fon Friday as the UK endures its fifth
OL,12,Fheatwave of the summer.
OL,14,FDrivers reported falling ill with
OL,15,Fheatstroke, refusing to drive buses
OL,16,Fand narrowly avoiding crashes as a
OL,17,Fresult of their working conditions.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,FThe strikes, planned by Unite the
OL,8,FUnion for 11 different occasions
OL,9,Fbetween now and mid-October, are
OL,10,Furging Arriva to replace their air-
OL,11,Fcooling system with air conditioning.
OL,13,FPeter Crane, 62, who has driven for
OL,14,FArriva for 22 years, showed the Press
OL,15,FAssociation a photo of his cab
OL,16,Ftemperature reading at 44C on Friday.
OL,18,FHe said: "We're so fed up, we get into
OL,19,Fthe bus, and it's absolutely boiling.
OL,26,@zD@JOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,F"It makes you drowsy. It makes you
OL,8,Ffeel a bit uncomfortable. You're
OL,9,Fsweating, you're sticky.
OL,11,F"It's like, you get off a plane, you
OL,12,Fgo to Greece or Spain or something."
OL,14,F"It's like being in a greenhouse.
OL,15,FThat's my life. You can't walk out.
OL,16,FIt's not like an air-conditioned
OL,17,Foffice. Not like our bosses, our
OL,18,Fdirectors, who are driving by with
OL,19,Fwhat we need, air-con in a car, it's
OL,20,Fcool.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUtD@dO]vD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,F"We just want the same thing. Why
OL,8,Fcan't we have air-con? Why can't we be
OL,9,Fcomfortable and safe?
OL,11,FAsked what his message to Arriva would
OL,12,Fbe, Mr Crane said: "Do you really care
OL,13,Fabout the comfort of your staff?
OL,14,FBecause there's no evidence of it.
OL,15,FIt's all talk."
OL,17,FMr Crane was amongst around 50 drivers
OL,18,Fstriking outside Wood Green bus garage
OL,19,Fin north London.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@TOUwD@OO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,FProtesters gathered peacefully with
OL,8,Fmusic on, holding placards reading
OL,9,F"Too hot to work. Act now!" and union
OL,10,Fflags, and handing out pamphlets
OL,11,Freading "No to heatstroke. Yes to heat
OL,12,Fstrikes" as cars and buses honked
OL,13,Fhorns as they drove by.
OL,15,FDrivers work shifts of up to 10 hours
OL,16,Fwith a break in the middle, and have
OL,17,Fbeen told by Mayor of London Sir Sadiq
OL,18,FKhan that they have a right to refuse
OL,19,Fto drive a bus if it is too hot.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@[O]sD@IOUtD@HO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,FHowever, striking drivers said that
OL,8,Fthey feared following Sir Khan and
OL,9,FTransport for London (TfL) advice
OL,10,Fbecause of potential sanctions from
OL,11,Ftheir company.
OL,13,FA driver named Peter Skinner, 56,
OL,14,Fsaid: "It's very hard, very
OL,15,Fexhausting, tiring, it's awful.
OL,17,F"I know a young lady personally that
OL,18,Fworks in another garage who passed out
OL,19,Fas she stepped out a cab, she was
OL,20,Fpregnant at the time.
OL,26,@vD@GOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,F"The problem with TfL is we don't work
OL,8,Ffor TfL. So TFL would be making a lot
OL,9,Fof comments and statements that, to
OL,10,Fus, are irrelevant. We get Sadiq Khan
OL,11,Fsaying 'you don't have to drive a bus
OL,12,Fif it's not got working air
OL,13,Fconditioning', we do, because our
OL,14,Fgovernor says we do, we don't work for
OL,15,FSadiq Khan."
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@LO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,FMr Skinner added: "It's absolutely
OL,8,Fpressing, isn't it? How long is it
OL,9,Fgoing to be before a driver does pass
OL,10,Fout on the wheel? Think of the carnage
OL,11,Fof a 14-tonne bus with 80 people in
OL,12,Fit, that could make a big mess."
OL,14,FMoe Manir, 38, has driven buses since
OL,15,Fhe was 20 and, although he works for a
OL,16,Fdifferent company, used a day off to
OL,17,Fsupport the industrial action.
OL,26,@oD@SOUtD@`O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,FHe said: "I'm hearing colleagues say
OL,8,Fthey try to threaten sanctions, if
OL,9,Fthey try to come out the cab because
OL,10,Fit's too hot, threatening docked pay
OL,11,For being (put) up for disciplinary for
OL,12,Frefusing to drive buses that are too
OL,13,Fhot to drive, or taking too long on a
OL,14,Fbreak because of the hot cab.
OL,16,F"The only way you can fight back is to
OL,17,Fget colleagues together and stand on
OL,18,Fthe picket line.
OL,26,@oD@JOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,F"It's very difficult to concentrate
OL,8,Fand it's a safety critical role. It's
OL,9,Fvery easy that a scooter or cyclist
OL,10,Fcomes out from the side road, and if
OL,11,Fyou're tired or fatigued because of
OL,12,Fthe excessive heat, you could have a
OL,13,Ffatality there.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,F"When you go into a cab, it's a day
OL,8,Fand night difference (to a car).
OL,9,FYou're in an oven. You know, like,
OL,10,Fsometimes it feels like it's in a
OL,11,Fmicrowave when it gets so hot. So it's
OL,12,Flike a confined space and there's no
OL,13,Fventilation. Even if you open the
OL,14,Fwindow, that's not ventilation, it's
OL,15,Fhot air coming in."
OL,17,FUnite the Union regional officer Steve
OL,18,FStockwell said that driving conditions
OL,19,Fthis summer have been "some of the
OL,20,Fworst they've ever been", despite
OL,21,Funion warnings 18 months ago.
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@SO]{D@WOU|D@XO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G12/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,FOutlining what changes were being
OL,8,Fdemanded, he said: "There are two
OL,9,Fparties that need to make a change.
OL,10,FTfL send the spec sheets out that the
OL,11,Foperators have to use, so TFL needs to
OL,12,Fchange the specs.
OL,14,F"But the operators are the employers.
OL,15,FSo they need to do something to keep
OL,16,Four drivers cool, we need a structure
OL,17,Fto get air conditioning on all our
OL,18,Fbuses."
OL,26,@pD@TOUvD@AOUzD@GO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G13/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37214
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,FWasim Mohammed, managing director of
OL,8,FArriva London, said: "Extreme heat is
OL,9,Fcreating challenges across many
OL,10,Fsectors, including London's bus
OL,11,Fnetwork. The wellbeing of our
OL,12,Fcolleagues and customers is our top
OL,13,Fpriority, and we are working closely
OL,14,Fwith Transport for London to ensure
OL,15,Fappropriate support is in place.
OL,26,@pD@VOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G14/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37215
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786915123
OL,3,CBus drivers go on strike as extreme
OL,4,Cheat in cabs 'could lead to fatal
OL,5,Ccrashes'
OL,7,F"We have already introduced additional
OL,8,Fsupport for drivers during hot
OL,9,Fweather, including regular breaks and
OL,10,Fwelfare checks ` and are continuing to
OL,11,Finvest in long-term improvements,
OL,12,Fincluding upgraded air conditioning
OL,13,Fsystems and new buses coming into our
OL,14,Ffleet.
OL,16,F"These upgrades are complex and being
OL,17,Fled by TfL as part of its extreme heat
OL,18,Ftaskforce. We urge Unite to come back
OL,19,Fto the negotiating table and engage
OL,20,Fwith us constructively so we can avoid
OL,21,Ffurther disruption."
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@AOU}D@TO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G15/15
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
